                <pb facs="0354" n="289" sameAs="frus:frus1936v03/pg289"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">765.84/4476: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister Resident in Ethiopia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Engert</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Addis
                                Ababa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-05-20T17:00:00+03:00">May 20, 1936—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 8:10 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>362. Marshal Badoglio is leaving tomorrow and Marshal Graziani who arrived
                    yesterday is assuming supreme command in Ethiopia.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Engert</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
